  r63,"a-non-thread-safe-observer-works-correctly-under-concurrency",workflow 并发执行且注册了一个带可变状态的 observer,workflow 产生多条事件并触发该 observer,observer 的回调 MUST 不被并发调用（同一时刻最多一个回调在执行）,true
  r307,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r307,"observer-loader-call-payload-is-summarized-under-workflow-co",workflow 以并发模式运行且注册了订阅 loader call 事件的 observer,某个 loader 返回一个大结果并触发 loader call 事件,被 capture 的事件 payload MUST 为 summary 结构（包含类型信息）,true
  r307,"typed-hook-loader-call-payload-is-summarized-under-workflow-",workflow 以并发模式运行且注册了订阅 loader_call 的 typed hook,某个 loader 返回一个大结果并触发 loader call hook,被 capture 的 loader_call 记录中 result MUST 为 summary 结构（包含类型信息）,true
  r430,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r430,"non-thread-safe-observer-does-not-corrupt-file-outputs-under",并发执行且启用了文件输出,多个执行单元触发事件写出,输出文件 MUST 保持可解析且不发生并发写入损坏,true
  r524,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r524,"repeating-a-concurrent-run-yields-the-same-event-order","",对同一 workflow 配置在并发模式下重复运行多次,关键编排级事件序列 MUST 保持一致顺序,true